    rule as a single source of truth in docs/debian-canonical-compliance.md
    and point README.md and docs/architecture.md at it.
  * Keep the boot-record and progress regression tests fully deterministic,
    offline and rootless.
  * Mark test-only build dependencies <!nocheck> and skip the build-time
    test suite under nocheck in either DEB_BUILD_OPTIONS or
    DEB_BUILD_PROFILES.
  * Stop shipping the redundant icon-set LICENSE inside the binary package;
    the icons are MIT and already covered by debian/copyright.

