  * Route snapshot create/restore tar operations through the configured
    privilege helper for protected rootfs content.
  * Document the DistroForge platform architecture contract and snapshot UX.
  * Extract build argument registration from the CLI monolith into the build
    command adapter and add platform guardrails against monolith growth.
  * Move GUI build guidance copy into a dedicated module covering user levels,
    privilege behavior and rollback snapshot safety.
  * Move build diff and compatibility report writing out of BuildOrchestrator
    into a host report artifact service.
  * Add a maintainer publish bundle that gathers ISO release evidence and
    writes an explicit release-gate verdict for review.
  * Add release manifest generation and safe-by-default GPG signing plans for
    maintainer publish bundles.
  * Add maintainer release notes and changelog generation from publish bundle
    evidence.
  * Add release bundle verification with manifest, checksum, gate and signature
    review checks.
  * Add a maintainer release pipeline command that bundles, signs, documents and
    verifies publication evidence in one run.
  * Add normalized boot proof planning/execution reports and require ready proof
    before the release gate accepts boot evidence.
  * Add a build option contract registry covering CLI flags, UX levels, GUI
    surfaces, GUI tokens, defaults and documented exceptions.
  * Extract the Build & Release page layout from the main GUI shell into a
    dedicated build page module.
