    preflight, progress, dry-run output and snapshot recovery.
  * Extract GUI widget to BuildOptions mapping into a dedicated UI mapper and
    make parity audits inspect split GUI modules.
  * Extract GUI-to-CLI preview rendering into a dedicated UI adapter.
  * Add an executable product workflow map and readiness diagnostics for feature
    opportunity, risk context and supporting proof.
  * Align experience mode labels with the product levels: beginner, power user,
    maintainer and developer.
