    test suite can run on a clean source tree without build-context skips.
  * Upgrade the Debian autopkgtest smoke to validate installed CLI, TOML package
    data and YAML examples, and make packaging policy block weak smoke tests.
  * Add a guided distro build journey for beginner, power-user, maintainer and
    developer paths across CLI and GUI Command Center surfaces.
  * Make build journey steps actionable through shared CLI and GUI apply/open
    actions that seed project state or write reviewable build definitions.
